      "options": {
        "content": "## Pi3B+ Performance Optimization Active\n\nThis dashboard shows minimal metrics to reduce system load on Raspberry Pi 3B+:\n\n- **RPT Active Links**: Core connectivity status for each node\n- **Collection Status**: Confirms metrics collection is working\n- **2-minute intervals**: Reduces disk I/O and CPU usage\n\n**Note**: Enhanced metrics (IAX2, log analysis, noise levels) are disabled to prevent system overload.\n\nFor full metrics on more powerful hardware, use the complete enhanced monitoring configuration.",
